[[16,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Undo the bolts fixing the intermediate driveshaft to the support.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223002318.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[16,7,0,"<p>1. Remove the intermediate driveshaft.</p><p>2. Remove the dust excluder.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Collect the transmission fluid which comes out in a suitable container.</p></aside><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223002319.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[16,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Place the intermediate driveshaft, complete with dust excluder, back in its housing.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Take care not to damage the differential side oil seal whilst fitting the intermediate driveshaft.</p></aside><p>1. Tighten the bolt fixing the intermediate driveshaft to the support to the recommended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223000656.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>-</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223002320.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[8,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Undo bolts (1a) securing the intermediate drive shaft to mount (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223002321.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[8,7,0,"<p>1. Withdraw and emove the intermediate driveshaft with mount.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Collect the fluid emerging from the differential in a suitable container.</p></aside><p>2. Remove the dust cover from the intermediate drive shaft.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223002322.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[8,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Place the intermediate driveshaft, complete with dust cover, back in its housing, taking care not to damage the differential side seal.</p><p>1. Tighten the bolts securing the intermediate driveshaft to the support to the recommended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223000656.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>-</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223002323.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"]]